layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"shaodi-q-o013","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0cd1e6082bde64409582","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，吴将朱然等围襄阳之樊城，太傅司马宣王率众拒之。﹝一﹞六月，辛丑〖5〗，退。己卯〖6〗，以征东将军王凌为车骑将军〖7〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o133b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8af6f7908a818f7cd9b1","layer":"original","quote":"琮与魏将王凌，战于芍陂；中郎将秦晃等十余人，战死。车骑将军朱然围樊，大将军诸葛瑾取柤中〖15〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":56,"end":104},{"id":"zhulv-q-b67f8c2f45d747b56b24","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-d611d5b9e32237bf8be4","layer":"original","quote":"朱然攻樊，据与朱异破城外围；还，拜偏将军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":45,"end":65},{"id":"zhulv-q-c03cc9d0b63dbe4212b5","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-eaa5bf5e18e62b235391","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌四年，随朱然攻魏樊城；建计破其外围，还拜偏将军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
